      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12819/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rinse scallops and place in a medium bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Wxn9SbefPisTHVVhQXJbaTsUJN8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12819-ceviche-ddmfs-step2-3x4-de76c5309b77489a9e5e7b3c5b443a30.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12819/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour lime juice over scallops; scallops should be completely immersed in lime juice.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tbj1hStmtp64sav6pb-6mKnGe70=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12819-ceviche-ddmfs-step3-3x4-c6adaa466a2d43c983a41f64405d4fa8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12819/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and chill in the refrigerator until scallops are opaque, 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GCHyvWHzxL6gq6QWmEZowolV_bA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12819-ceviche-ddmfs-step3-3x4-e69f368bf9734a489e8ce0a75c836134.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12819/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Discard 1/2 of the lime juice from the bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/t1mtrjzXl5kLUEljySXNST0h4qg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-12819-ceviche-ddmfs-step4-3x4-d880d08fad0d4ed299d4c1eb4b6456c5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12819/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add celery, tomatoes, bell pepper, green onions, parsley, cilantro, olive oil, and black pepper; stir gently until combined.",
